WEBVTT

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.040
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.610
This week, it's this!

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.430
A black card?

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:11.680
What is this?

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:13.360
For details, watch the show!

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.610
Okay?

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.970
C'mon!

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.700
You must be joking!

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:26.510
We lost the feed right when the Crimson 
Dragon appeared and made things exciting!

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.160
Maybe it broke.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.300
It's a TV in a junkyard, after all.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.720
All right!  We can watch!

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.350
The winner is Yusei Fudo!

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:41.220
Yusei!

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:39.910
It's the birth of the new King!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.770
What happened?

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:44.780
I don't believe it.

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.490
Look at Yusei.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.400
He won.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.170
Yusei is the King?

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:54.590
All right!

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:55.300
Yeah!  He did it!

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:56.130
I knew he could do it!

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.040
That's why he's Yusei!

00:00:58.040 --> 00:00:59.610
Hooray!

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:01.580
Yusei!

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.340
This is unbelievable!

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.670
That's right!  The winner 
is Yusei Fudo!  Jack lost!

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:17.420
The person who defeated the King 
of Kings Jack Atlas was Yusei Fudo-

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:23.000
For the first time ever, Satellite 
gives birth to a new King!

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.480
His name is Yusei Fudo!

00:01:25.930 --> 00:01:31.060
What are you doing, Angela?  I was filming!

00:01:31.430 --> 00:01:34.990
Oh, I'm sorry.  I thought 
you were rehearsing.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:39.720
You're the same as ever, angry Carly.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.590
What did you say?

00:01:41.590 --> 00:01:43.500
Are you getting angry?

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:48.050
Anyway, I don't have time for 
you right now.  Interviews.

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:50.600
Me too!

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:56.760
Yusei!

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:14.700
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:19.800
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:24.710
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:29.480
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:34.850
No matter how bad today is

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.860
There’s still the faintest light

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:45.230
All I have to do tomorrow

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:49.300
Is light it myself

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:54.300
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:59.270
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:05.580
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:09.550
Today will never exist again

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:15.460
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:44.890
World With No Light  Dark Synchro
Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.640
Yusei!

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:58.650
Jack, what we saw was…

00:03:59.150 --> 00:04:01.150
Satellite punk!

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.250
I know you cheated!

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:05.080
You're a brat with a Marker!

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.990
I won't accept someone from 
Satellite being the King!

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.620
Yusei!

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:14.950
Lua!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.830
Bro, let's flee!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.910
Look over there!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.560
Yusei Fudo!  New King!

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:23.370
Give me an interview!

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:28.530
Yusei, hurry!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.270
Right.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:37.210
You're going to let Yusei Fudo escape?

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:41.770
What happened anyway?  
How could the King lose?

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:44.850
That's a trivial issue.

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:50.140
The stars have started to move.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:53.520
They will soon become one.  That's 
the moment I'm waiting for.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.590
No one's here.  Where did they go?

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:01.680
Then there's nothing to report.

00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:10.930
They used this passageway when 
they were building the stadium.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:13.480
I never knew this existed.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:15.870
It's because no one uses it anymore.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:17.600
I learned about this from Saiga.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:23.720
Anyway, Bro, you're awesome.  
You actually became the King.

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:27.330
I always knew that you would 
become the King, Yusei!

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:28.850
Yeah!

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.930
This isn't the time to celebrate.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:37.700
They kidnapped Yusei's friends.  We 
don't know what they're capable of.

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:43.920
For now, we should stay at Saiga's hideout.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:47.190
It'll also be safer if Lua 
and Luca stays with us.

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.540
Really?

00:05:48.540 --> 00:05:51.840
Hooray!  I can be with Yusei again!

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:54.370
Yusei…

00:05:54.950 --> 00:06:00.930
I saw your duel against 
Jack inside the light.

00:06:02.530 --> 00:06:04.760
Satellite was…

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.860
What was that?

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:16.380
I don't know.

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:21.190
However, if that was a vision of 
Satellite's future, I'll stop it.

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:25.420
What's a Signer?

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:29.140
Ta-daa!  I'm the expert 
on those kinds of stories.

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.140
Ready, Luca?  A Signer is…

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:38.820
Whoa!  Before that, I'll first have to talk 
about my numerous adventures around the world.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.110
I'm nervous.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:00.080
I wonder if I'll be able 
to ask good questions.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:05.260
In times like this, I depend 
on my fortune-telling deck!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:11.030
Today's fortune is super happy!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.300
If you keep moving forward, all 
your wishes will come true!

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.310
All right!

00:07:16.510 --> 00:07:17.710
Director Godwin!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.280
What happened inside that light?

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:23.100
Was the Crimson Dragon a monster card?

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:27.810
Did Jack really lose?  Many 
fans refuse to accept it.

00:07:28.390 --> 00:07:33.150
I apologize that during the final 
duel, we couldn't show what

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:38.150
was happening because there was an 
error in the holographic system.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:42.610
We will give specifics on 
the duel at a later date.

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:47.190
Can you give us information 
about the new King Yusei Fudo?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:50.800
We don't know anything except 
that he's from Satellite.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:53.030
In that case...

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:57.050
If I just keep moving forward, 
all my wishes will come true!

00:07:57.340 --> 00:07:59.950
Where's Jack right now?

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:02.520
What are you doing?

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:10.870
When the Crimson Dragon appeared, it 
looked like Yusei Fudo's arm was glowing.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:12.870
Did that mean anything?

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:21.400
I didn't notice that.

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:22.970
Then what was-

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.630
Why are you asking questions 
that are off-topic?

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.180
But…

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:27.590
Well then…

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:29.990
We're done with questions.

00:08:29.990 --> 00:08:34.370
We'll make announcements later, 
so this is it for today.

00:08:34.770 --> 00:08:36.660
No way!

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.810
Please back up.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:41.070
Director!  Just one more question!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:42.690
Director Godwin!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:53.460
Both Yusei Fudo and the Director have left.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.110
That means the only one left is Jack!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:56.300
Exactly.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.770
I'm going first!

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.940
Stop her!

00:08:59.940 --> 00:09:03.690
I also just have to keep moving forward!

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:12.890
What are you doing, Carly?

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.260
I've been calling you many times!

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.440
I'm sorry, Editor.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.960
Did you get a quote from the new King?

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:21.690
Umm, he escaped.

00:09:21.980 --> 00:09:26.000
What are you doing?  If you keep 
messing around, I'll fire you!

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.580
There are many people who can replace you.

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:33.840
Please wait!  If you want 
a scoop, I have a scoop!

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:36.180
A scoop?  Really?

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.220
I'm getting the details right now.

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.590
Just leave room on the front page!

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:42.800
Okay, you better get the scoop!

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:44.230
Understood!

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:01.460
Yusei's arm is definitely glowing!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:04.650
Director Godwin was playing 
dumb, but there's something.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:09.110
By finding out how this relates to the 
Crimson Dragon, it'll be my ticket to success!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.880
Duel Disk detected fifteen 
degrees to the left.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:23.020
Even the streets have star players, 
but they won't advance beyond that.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:27.300
Very few will make it, like me.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:33.360
That's right!  That's why I 
won't return to the streets!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.150
I won't let this opportunity escape!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:41.040
I'll drive on the highways!  
I'll only move forward!

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.410
What?

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.460
The engine stalled!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:16.320
The Signers have finally gathered.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.290
The Signers have finally gathered.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:40.880
It took five thousand years.

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:46.410
That's why our battle against 
the Signers is unique.

00:11:47.020 --> 00:11:49.870
They'll taste everything 
until there's nothing left.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:54.730
It's time to lower the curtain of shadows.

00:12:15.730 --> 00:12:19.080
It's something I saw a long time ago.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:23.570
I don't remember exactly, but 
it's something like this.

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:29.950
This tail…

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.270
Yusei, what's wrong?

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.240
Luca, what about you?

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:52.180
Luca has the claw.  What does this mean?

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:59.540
According to the legend of the people of the 
stars, the Crimson Dragon's head, wings, claws,

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:07.540
legs and tail were split into five parts and 
sealed away as marks among people known as Signers.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:16.420
Hold on.  There are only four Signers that 
we know about: Yusei, Luca, Jack and Aki Izayoi.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:19.320
But the Crimson Dragon still appeared.

00:13:19.840 --> 00:13:23.310
That means the fifth person 
may have been nearby.

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:36.410
Maybe I have a mark somewhere.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:45.130
Luca!

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.110
Luca, what's wrong?

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:50.850
I'm okay.  I'm just a little tired.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:55.820
We understand.  Lots of things 
happened in just two days.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:15.360
No visitors allowed.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:18.330
That means we can't get 
an interview with Jack.

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.830
I'm going to wait it out!

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.780
I'm just going to keep moving forward!

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:33.620
The Crimson Dragon has come!

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.200
The legendary Crimson Dragon!

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:40.560
It yearns for blood and 
brings despair to the land!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:46.620
In order to destroy the red 
light, join us and fight it!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:50.980
Dark shadows will envelop the light!

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:33.510
It's throbbing, but it feels different 
than usual.  It feels like it's gouging.

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.990
Is that a Signer?

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:48.450
Wait!

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.350
What is this place?

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:05.460
Why are you running?

00:16:18.090 --> 00:16:19.630
Who are you?

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.300
Do you know?

00:16:24.150 --> 00:16:26.280
Do you know what's going 
to happen to Satellite?

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:30.510
Listen to the Shadow Duel.  
The shadows know everything.

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:34.600
Shadow Duel?

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:37.260
Fine, I'll listen to 
everything you want to say!

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:40.240
Duel!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.510
What is this?

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:54.240
We'll be sacrificed to the altar of 
shadows.  You can no longer escape.

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:55.490
What are you talking about?

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:56.820
My turn.

00:16:57.250 --> 00:17:00.010
I summon Blizzard Lizard in defense position.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:06.150
I set one card and end my turn.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.590
Duel Disk detected.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:15.350
That number is incredibly high!  I've never 
seen anything like that before.  What is it?

00:17:19.610 --> 00:17:21.940
That light…  Can it be?

00:17:22.530 --> 00:17:23.570
My turn!

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.890
I activate the spell card Tuning.

00:17:28.590 --> 00:17:31.850
I add one Tuner Monster from my 
deck to my hand, and then I send a

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:35.850
card from my deck to the graveyard 
for every Level of the Tuner Monster.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:37.920
Junk Synchron is Level 3.

00:17:38.270 --> 00:17:41.780
I send three cards from 
my deck to the graveyard.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.040
I summon Junk Synchron!

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:49.050
When Junk Synchron is successfully 
summoned, I can Special Summon

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:53.050
one Level 2-or-below monster from 
my graveyard in defense position.

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.550
I call forth Speed Warrior!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:03.470
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:22.740
The stars come together to call forth a new 
power!  Become the path that lights the way!

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:24.440
Synchro Summon!

00:18:25.510 --> 00:18:27.790
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:36.380
Battle!  Junk Warrior 
attacks Blizzard Lizard!

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.850
Scrap Fist!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.300
Blizzard Tail!

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:49.010
Blizzard Lizard's monster effect activates.

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:54.770
When this card is destroyed, 
you take 300 points of damage.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:19:00.060
I actually felt pain.  That means 
he has the same power as Izayoi.

00:19:00.490 --> 00:19:02.510
However, something is different.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.840
Can it be?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.960
My attacks will also hurt him for real.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:15.640
A special power must be 
controlling this duel.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:21.970
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:24.280
My turn.

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.260
I draw.

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:28.430
The Continuous Trap Call of the Haunted.

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:34.060
I select one monster in my graveyard and 
Special Summon it in attack position.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.680
I resurrect Blizzard Lizard.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:42.170
Then from my hand, I activate 
the spell card Ice Mirror.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:47.410
I select one Level 3-or-below 
Water Attribute monster on my

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:52.410
field, and I can Special Summon 
the same monster from my deck.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.520
Then from my hand…

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.620
Another Ice Mirror!

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:04.450
I summon a third Blizzard Lizard.

00:20:06.580 --> 00:20:08.380
What are you planning to do?

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:12.480
I release two Blizzard LizardS!

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:17.210
I Advance Summon Level 8 
Dark Tuner Catastrogue!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:19.730
Dark Tuner?

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:28.350
Dark Tuner Catastrogue dark tunes 
the remaining Blizzard Lizard!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.620
Dark Tuner Catastrogue is Level 8.

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:34.340
Blizzard Lizard is Level 3.

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:39.380
Shadows, show yourself!

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:54.210
What's going on?  The stars have turned dark.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:57.110
That's right.  The light 
has turned into shadows.

00:20:57.110 --> 00:21:01.710
Dark Synchro Summoning lets me summon 
a Synchro Monster whose Level is

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:06.710
equal to the non-Tuner Monster's Level 
subtracted by the Dark Tuner's Level.

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:11.680
No way.  You can't subtract 
Level 8 from Level 3!

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:18.140
In the shadow world, a negative 
Level 5 monster exists.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.950
No way…

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:26.860
When shadow stacks on shadows, the 
door to the realm of the dead opens.

00:21:26.860 --> 00:21:29.090
A world without light!

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:31.190
Dark Synchro!

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:34.700
Come!  Frozen Fitzgerald!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:48.390
Dark Tuning?  I can't believe it.

00:22:12.830 --> 00:22:17.300
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:17.670 --> 00:22:22.380
We will build our own future

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:27.810
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:32.990
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:48.130
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:48.570 --> 00:22:53.710
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.410
Even if it loses its light

00:22:58.880 --> 00:23:03.670
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:08.150
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:08.350 --> 00:23:13.730
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:18.600
This journey has no end

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:24.070
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:24.500 --> 00:23:29.310
Hear my voice
